third_reading.remarks:
December 11, 2023 - Senate requested for a conference committee;
December 13, 2023 - House agreed to form a conference committee;
December 13, 2023 - Designation of bicam conferees with Reps. Enverga, Suansing (M.), Suansing (H.), Nograles, Estrella, Emano, Plaza, Singson-Meehan, Quimbo, Lee, Tan and Ferrer;
January 10, 2024 - Message recieved by the Senate on the designation of House conferees; 
January 22, 2024 - House designated Rep. Briones as additional conferee to the bicameral conference committee; 
January 24, 2024 - Message received by the Senate on the designation of Rep. Briones as additional conferee; 
March 18, 2024 - House designated Rep. Acharon vice Rep. Ferrer as additional conferee to the bicameral conference committee;
March 19, 2024 - Message received by the Senate on the designation of Rep. Acharon vice Rep. Ferrer as conferee to the bicameral conference committee;
May 22, 2024 - House ratified the conference committee report (cc message received by the Senate on May 23, 2024;
May 22, 2024 - Senate approved the conference committee report (cc message received by the House on May 23, 2024;
July 29, 2024 - Reconsideration of the ratification of the conference committee  report (Reconsideration message received by the Senate on July 30, 2024);
July 29, 2024 -House conferees reconstituted (House conferees message received by the Senate on July 30, 2024.
